{"data":{"body":"**P2: Await actual exits before checking the registry.** The preceding `get()` calls await logical completion, which `ExecutorTaskHandle.run()` publishes before `markExited()` removes the task. This assertion can therefore fail under valid thread scheduling. Await each saved handle's `exit()` future before asserting that the registry is empty.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc8AAAABAE3lRw","finding_digest":"77dbaf19defbee28cc53f1dff25d8dc543fa05e32adb18382b67ff82d84d06aa","finding_id":"arf_v1_o7n26go67pxcrtct6hp7exmnyv","finding_key":"sdk/src/test/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/executionmanagertest.java::tracksrootstepchildandcoordinatortasks::registry-check-before-task-exit","identity_key":"sdk/src/test/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/executionmanagertest.java::tracksrootstepchildandcoordinatortasks::registry-check-before-task-exit","line":1043,"observation_digest":"a8d5140830d63571ab74c88fb168e5de5667ae5d9c08708667179e56ee6a8415","observation_id":"aro_v1_vdkricbq2y2xdk3uzch3c2hf3z","path":"sdk/src/test/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/ExecutionManagerTest.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-16T22:58:20Z","review_id":"arr_v1_bniaut6wwkf4evgmnpotxs3njl","reviewed_base_sha":"edeb5075354b56fb522fea8f493e0a83d4b6aa26","reviewed_head_sha":"57404b0ed18bb891a75157bf3d6eb761cc30ac26","reviewer":"codex","start_line":1043,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_qsglrbkdk6v3v4eh4xaefxlg4d"},"pull_request":{"number":731},"record_id":"art_v1_atqnw5vw5cyfujalx5klbwicsg","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-16T22:58:20Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
